      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ……\r\n俺は確かに生きていた……。\r\n生きていたんだな……。",
        "official_en": "Ahh... So I <text style=\"italic\">was</>...\r\nI <text style=\"italic\">was</> alive after all...",
        "real_en": "Ah... I really was alive... I was alive after all..."
